     Confident factual | 1.000 | 0.000 |   4.7 | 0.000  |            SAFE
    Uncertain creative | 0.345 | 0.655 |   0.4 | 0.000  |         CAUTION
         Hallucinating | 0.677 | 0.323 |   0.8 | 0.000  |         CAUTION
